<title>HUNGARY: Hungary CIB Hungaria cuts prime rate to 23.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary CIB Hungaria cuts prime rate to 23.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's CIB Hungaria Bank Rt said it will reduce its prime lending rate on forint loans to 23.75 percent from 24.75 percent, effective October 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
